WEBVTT

00:00:18.810 --> 00:00:19.890
All right.

00:00:21.070 --> 00:00:22.850
The adjustments are fine.

00:00:27.150 --> 00:00:28.790
Looking great!

00:00:28.790 --> 00:00:30.720
Everyone looks good in the right clothes.

00:00:30.720 --> 00:00:32.580
I don't look like myself.

00:00:33.760 --> 00:00:35.580
It fits you.

00:00:36.340 --> 00:00:38.550
I want to know.

00:00:38.980 --> 00:00:42.300
The world you see during a Riding Duel.

00:00:42.550 --> 00:00:44.910
The world that you feel.

00:00:45.150 --> 00:00:46.170
Aki...

00:00:46.560 --> 00:00:49.100
I'll get my license.

00:00:51.380 --> 00:00:55.650
We built this using a 
junk shop's spare parts.

00:00:55.850 --> 00:00:58.230
It's good enough for practice.

00:01:01.590 --> 00:01:03.740
Thank you, Yusei.

00:01:03.970 --> 00:01:08.000
I'll use it to get my Riding Duel license.

00:01:24.910 --> 00:01:30.050
Every time you're hurt, you can become kinder

00:01:30.410 --> 00:01:35.580
Stand up and you'll understand strength

00:01:35.920 --> 00:01:40.060
Don't look back and keep going

00:01:40.290 --> 00:01:45.890
Both the past and the future 
are connected to the present

00:01:46.060 --> 00:01:50.870
There's no need to fear

00:01:51.100 --> 00:01:58.540
I'll keep telling you that you're not alone

00:01:59.610 --> 00:02:04.550
The passionate emotions in your heart

00:02:05.280 --> 00:02:10.320
Streak to the infinite future

00:02:10.520 --> 00:02:15.720
Dreams surpass their limits

00:02:15.990 --> 00:02:23.830
And will lead you to a bright place

00:02:50.400 --> 00:02:55.900
Aki IzayoiAcceleration!

00:02:56.110 --> 00:03:01.820
The WRGP was recently announced.

00:03:01.820 --> 00:03:04.970
It's not easy to get this license.

00:03:04.970 --> 00:03:06.420
Keep that in mind.

00:03:10.680 --> 00:03:14.160
I knew you wanted to enter the WRGP!

00:03:14.160 --> 00:03:16.110
Lua.  Luca.

00:03:17.320 --> 00:03:20.080
My goal isn't to enter the Grand Prix.

00:03:20.080 --> 00:03:23.600
I want to ride with Yusei and our friends.

00:03:23.600 --> 00:03:26.750
I want to feel the same wind 
and see the same things.

00:03:26.750 --> 00:03:29.330
Aki, you can do it!

00:03:29.330 --> 00:03:32.290
This isn't a place for girls!

00:03:32.290 --> 00:03:35.430
Riding Duels are a man's world!

00:03:35.430 --> 00:03:39.710
A girl should stay home and play with dolls.

00:03:40.530 --> 00:03:43.960
That's old-fashioned sexism!

00:03:43.960 --> 00:03:45.040
Aren't you embarrassed?

00:03:45.040 --> 00:03:47.040
Ooh, scary.

00:03:47.040 --> 00:03:49.130
We just wanted to warn you.

00:03:49.130 --> 00:03:51.300
Riding Duels aren't easy.

00:03:51.300 --> 00:03:53.980
It's harder than you think.

00:03:54.620 --> 00:03:56.950
I never thought it would be easy.

00:04:00.220 --> 00:04:02.120
Hey, stop wasting time!

00:04:02.120 --> 00:04:04.160
We're starting practice!

00:04:05.660 --> 00:04:10.960
Unlike normal, the autopilot 
is turned off during the WRGP.

00:04:10.960 --> 00:04:13.860
You can only count on your 
D-Wheel driving skills!

00:04:13.860 --> 00:04:16.000
Understand?  Begin!

00:04:16.000 --> 00:04:16.970
Right!

00:04:21.410 --> 00:04:22.870
They're riding.

00:04:24.340 --> 00:04:25.730
Watch!

00:04:25.730 --> 00:04:28.810
I'll start off fast and show you my skills!

00:04:37.610 --> 00:04:38.670
Damn!

00:04:38.670 --> 00:04:39.700
You fool!

00:04:39.700 --> 00:04:41.090
You're driving too fast!

00:04:41.090 --> 00:04:42.060
Next!

00:04:42.060 --> 00:04:42.600
Right!

00:04:43.430 --> 00:04:46.190
Drive safely...

00:04:46.190 --> 00:04:47.260
I did it!

00:04:46.190 --> 00:04:47.260
No good!

00:04:47.260 --> 00:04:50.940
If you drive too slow, they'll pass you!

00:04:50.940 --> 00:04:52.420
Next!

00:04:52.420 --> 00:04:52.940
Right!

00:04:55.440 --> 00:04:57.680
Aki, do your best!

00:04:59.860 --> 00:05:01.410
This speed...

00:05:01.410 --> 00:05:03.410
A real course is awesome!

00:05:04.240 --> 00:05:05.890
This feels great!

00:05:09.710 --> 00:05:11.110
Hey!

00:05:11.110 --> 00:05:12.620
You won't make the turn!

00:05:20.350 --> 00:05:21.820
Ouch...

00:05:28.030 --> 00:05:30.470
Aki works hard.

00:05:30.470 --> 00:05:31.010
Yeah.

00:05:32.440 --> 00:05:34.180
And at this point...

00:05:39.380 --> 00:05:41.110
Aki, are you okay?

00:05:40.020 --> 00:05:41.010
Aki!

00:05:41.110 --> 00:05:42.430
Aki!

00:05:42.430 --> 00:05:44.290
I almost made it!

00:05:45.390 --> 00:05:46.960
I know!

00:05:47.730 --> 00:05:51.720
If I hang on a little longer before 
speeding up, I'll make the turn.

00:05:51.720 --> 00:05:52.910
That's right!

00:05:52.910 --> 00:05:54.170
That will work!

00:05:54.170 --> 00:05:56.590
She's totally focused.

00:06:01.490 --> 00:06:02.940
You're leaning too much!

00:06:02.940 --> 00:06:04.680
Am I leaning too much?

00:06:07.720 --> 00:06:09.380
Use your body to turn!

00:06:09.560 --> 00:06:11.730
I know, but...

00:06:14.640 --> 00:06:16.300
You're pushing too hard!

00:06:16.300 --> 00:06:18.280
I'm pushing too hard!

00:06:20.880 --> 00:06:23.790
Yusei, I think I got it now!

00:06:24.900 --> 00:06:26.760
This will be the last run for today.

00:06:30.600 --> 00:06:32.980
The speed and angle of entry are both fine.

00:06:32.980 --> 00:06:34.930
The grip is also stable.

00:06:34.930 --> 00:06:37.010
This is when I have to speed up!

00:06:39.450 --> 00:06:40.950
I did it!

00:06:41.960 --> 00:06:43.680
You did it, Aki.

00:06:51.150 --> 00:06:52.960
Thank you, Yusei.

00:07:16.580 --> 00:07:19.550
You're incredible, Aki!

00:07:19.550 --> 00:07:21.290
You pass the test!

00:07:21.290 --> 00:07:22.800
I did it!

00:07:22.800 --> 00:07:25.160
Hooray!  She did it!

00:07:25.590 --> 00:07:27.990
I'll announce the test results.

00:07:28.200 --> 00:07:31.650
In this class, only Izayoi passed!

00:07:31.650 --> 00:07:34.260
The rest of you failed!

00:07:36.190 --> 00:07:37.700
Damn!

00:07:37.700 --> 00:07:39.420
How could I lose to that girl?

00:07:39.700 --> 00:07:41.710
This is unacceptable.

00:07:41.870 --> 00:07:42.770
Yeah.

00:07:43.840 --> 00:07:47.190
All that's left is the graduation duel.

00:07:47.190 --> 00:07:48.520
Give it your all!

00:07:48.520 --> 00:07:49.250
Right.

00:07:49.700 --> 00:07:54.050
This isn't on your training checklist, 
but from my own experience,

00:07:54.050 --> 00:07:57.250
there's one thing you should learn.

00:08:07.540 --> 00:08:08.570
It's this.

00:08:09.050 --> 00:08:10.530
Back turn?

00:08:10.530 --> 00:08:12.000
Yes.

00:08:12.000 --> 00:08:16.120
If you master this, you can 
deal with most situations.

00:08:16.120 --> 00:08:17.510
I'll try!

00:08:23.440 --> 00:08:24.740
Watch out!

00:08:31.870 --> 00:08:34.090
It's pretty difficult.

00:08:39.330 --> 00:08:41.900
Are we a third wheel?

00:08:41.900 --> 00:08:43.630
It's not a date.

00:08:43.630 --> 00:08:47.030
This is the best way to learn how it feels.

00:08:55.790 --> 00:08:58.180
Is this your first time skating?

00:08:58.910 --> 00:09:01.650
I've never been to a place like this.

00:09:01.650 --> 00:09:03.420
It's a date.

00:09:03.420 --> 00:09:07.200
I can see why you'd think that...

00:09:20.900 --> 00:09:22.910
They're having a good time.

00:09:22.910 --> 00:09:25.390
Maybe it is a date.

00:09:25.820 --> 00:09:27.660
Good!  Keep it up!

00:09:27.660 --> 00:09:30.520
I just need to focus on my center of gravity.

00:09:36.990 --> 00:09:38.080
Hey!

00:09:38.660 --> 00:09:40.460
You should thank us.

00:09:40.460 --> 00:09:42.040
What's this?

00:09:42.040 --> 00:09:44.460
Crow and Jack helped.

00:09:44.930 --> 00:09:46.900
It's your D-Wheel, Aki.

00:09:47.120 --> 00:09:48.870
You built this for me?

00:09:48.870 --> 00:09:51.390
I worked on the brakes.

00:09:51.390 --> 00:09:52.840
I painted the frame.

00:09:52.840 --> 00:09:54.160
Everyone...

00:09:55.840 --> 00:09:57.410
It's time.

00:09:58.450 --> 00:10:01.870
I promise to get my license!

00:10:02.740 --> 00:10:04.110
Do your best!

00:10:13.590 --> 00:10:15.030
There they are!

00:10:25.470 --> 00:10:27.470
It's crazy from the start.

00:10:30.210 --> 00:10:31.710
Sheesh.

00:10:31.710 --> 00:10:33.640
The license duel isn't a joke.

00:10:33.640 --> 00:10:35.650
It's Ushio!

00:10:35.880 --> 00:10:39.040
I'm seeing the same faces again.

00:10:39.040 --> 00:10:42.470
Izayoi, you're unlucky.

00:10:42.470 --> 00:10:47.830
Ever since the Grand Prix was announced, 
more people want their license.

00:10:47.830 --> 00:10:50.590
This test is designed for you to fail.

00:10:50.590 --> 00:10:53.300
In order to pass, you have to beat me.

00:10:53.300 --> 00:10:54.650
Sheesh!

00:10:54.650 --> 00:10:57.300
After everything we did for him!

00:10:57.300 --> 00:10:59.590
Izayoi can't win.

00:10:59.590 --> 00:11:01.270
Just watch, Izayoi.

00:11:01.480 --> 00:11:04.760
You won't finish the race.

00:11:08.480 --> 00:11:11.900
Izayoi, I won't show any mercy.

00:11:11.900 --> 00:11:12.950
That's what I expect.

00:11:12.950 --> 00:11:16.970
Begin the Riding Duel for 
the driver's license!

00:11:16.970 --> 00:11:18.700
Riding Duel!

00:11:18.700 --> 00:11:20.520
Acceleration!

00:11:26.030 --> 00:11:30.000
Field Spell Speed World 2 set!

00:11:30.220 --> 00:11:32.000
Duel Mode on.

00:11:36.530 --> 00:11:39.840
If I take the first corner 
before him, I'll go first.

00:11:40.010 --> 00:11:42.150
Let's see how you do.

00:11:44.960 --> 00:11:45.880
It's mine!

00:11:47.350 --> 00:11:49.590
Aki gets to go first!

00:11:51.290 --> 00:11:53.860
What's wrong?  You're going first!

00:11:53.860 --> 00:11:55.240
It's your turn!

00:11:55.240 --> 00:11:55.930
C'mon!

00:11:57.110 --> 00:12:01.940
If you're already scared, you'll 
never be able to Riding Duel!

00:12:01.940 --> 00:12:05.150
Ushio is playing rough!

00:12:05.150 --> 00:12:07.110
That's horrible!

00:12:07.110 --> 00:12:09.640
It happens often in Riding Duels.

00:12:10.270 --> 00:12:11.320
Aki...

00:12:11.870 --> 00:12:14.400
Don't fall for Ushio's pace.

00:12:33.280 --> 00:12:35.870
My turn.  I draw!

00:12:36.080 --> 00:12:39.840
In a Riding Duel, this Speed 
Spell will be the key.

00:12:39.840 --> 00:12:44.370
How much momentum can you create this turn?

00:12:44.950 --> 00:12:47.740
I summon Revival Rose in defense position!

00:12:50.010 --> 00:12:53.310
I activate Speed Spell - Summon Speeder!

00:12:56.310 --> 00:12:58.960
What is Izayoi doing?

00:12:59.900 --> 00:13:03.700
You need Speed Counters to use a Speed Spell.

00:13:03.700 --> 00:13:05.700
She's very nervous.

00:13:07.710 --> 00:13:09.010
Oh yeah.

00:13:09.010 --> 00:13:10.770
I forgot about Speed Counters.

00:13:13.280 --> 00:13:15.150
Stop stalling!

00:13:15.150 --> 00:13:16.740
I end my turn!

00:13:20.210 --> 00:13:21.790
My turn!

00:13:23.210 --> 00:13:24.510
Here I go.

00:13:24.990 --> 00:13:27.680
I summon Stygian Street Patrol!

00:13:30.920 --> 00:13:32.400
Battle!

00:13:32.400 --> 00:13:35.590
Stygian Street Patrol attacks Revival Rose!

00:13:42.170 --> 00:13:44.610
Stygian Street Patrol's effect!

00:13:44.610 --> 00:13:49.050
You take damage equal to the destroyed 
monster's Level multiplied by 100 points!

00:13:51.360 --> 00:13:53.980
I set one card and end my turn!

00:13:54.510 --> 00:13:56.700
I have to overcome my fear.

00:13:56.700 --> 00:13:58.050
What's wrong?

00:13:58.050 --> 00:13:59.560
Bring it, Izayoi!

00:14:02.440 --> 00:14:04.030
My turn.

00:14:04.030 --> 00:14:04.760
I draw!

00:14:06.220 --> 00:14:09.260
I summon Twilight Rose Knight!

00:14:13.310 --> 00:14:16.530
When this monster is successfully summoned,

00:14:16.530 --> 00:14:21.910
I can Special Summon a Level 4-or-below 
Plant-Type monster from my hand!

00:14:21.910 --> 00:14:24.370
I Special Summon Lord Poison!

00:14:26.880 --> 00:14:28.900
Nice, Aki!

00:14:28.900 --> 00:14:30.080
She's getting the hang of it!

00:14:30.410 --> 00:14:35.280
Level 3 Twilight Rose Knight 
turns Level 4 Lord Poison!

00:14:36.090 --> 00:14:39.790
The cold flame envelops the entire world.

00:14:39.790 --> 00:14:41.860
Black flower, bloom!

00:14:42.260 --> 00:14:43.490
Synchro Summon!

00:14:43.690 --> 00:14:46.930
Appear, Black Rose Dragon!

00:14:48.240 --> 00:14:50.230
Izayoi...

00:14:50.230 --> 00:14:55.970
You can't scare me by summoning Black 
Rose Dragon when you're flustered.

00:14:56.180 --> 00:14:57.190
Battle!

00:14:57.190 --> 00:15:00.480
Black Rose Dragon attacks 
Stygian Street Patrol!

00:15:00.480 --> 00:15:02.980
Burn him up!  Black Rose Flare!

00:15:05.170 --> 00:15:07.170
Not good enough, Izayoi.

00:15:07.170 --> 00:15:10.720
I activate the trap card Final Penalty!

00:15:11.120 --> 00:15:16.230
When a monster is destroyed in battle, you 
take damage equal to half its attack points.

00:15:16.230 --> 00:15:20.700
Then the attacking monster is destroyed!

00:15:23.630 --> 00:15:25.640
She's lost her cool.

00:15:25.640 --> 00:15:27.310
Aki, stay alert!

00:15:27.310 --> 00:15:28.850
Strike back at him!

00:15:28.850 --> 00:15:35.080
When a monster is destroyed, I can Special 
Summon Revival Rose from my graveyard.

00:15:36.010 --> 00:15:38.800
I set two cards and end my turn!

00:15:38.800 --> 00:15:40.090
My turn!

00:15:41.580 --> 00:15:44.560
By removing Stygian Street Patrol 
in my graveyard from play,

00:15:44.560 --> 00:15:50.230
I can Special Summon a Fiend-Type monster 
with 2000-or-fewer attack points from my hand!

00:15:50.440 --> 00:15:54.280
I Special Summon another 
Stygian Street Patrol!

00:15:56.930 --> 00:16:00.440
Next, I summon Stygian Security!

00:16:02.950 --> 00:16:08.110
Level 1 Stygian Security tunes 
Level 4 Stygian Street Patrol.

00:16:08.450 --> 00:16:10.080
Synchro Summon!

00:16:11.110 --> 00:16:15.180
Come, Stygian Sergeants!

00:16:16.050 --> 00:16:17.670
Battle!

00:16:17.670 --> 00:16:20.520
Stygian Sergeants attacks Revival Rose!

00:16:21.370 --> 00:16:23.160
I'm not done.

00:16:23.160 --> 00:16:28.400
Stygian Sergeants are scary 
twin beast policemen.

00:16:28.400 --> 00:16:33.400
When Stygian Sergeants successfully destroys 
your monster in battle, it can attack again.

00:16:33.400 --> 00:16:37.410
And it gains 800 attack points this time!

00:16:39.650 --> 00:16:40.990
What?

00:16:40.990 --> 00:16:43.190
Aki has 2800 life points.

00:16:43.190 --> 00:16:45.620
If this attack succeeds, Aki will lose!

00:16:47.300 --> 00:16:49.460
I attack you directly!

00:16:54.190 --> 00:16:55.690
I activate a trap!

00:16:55.850 --> 00:16:57.230
Offensive Guard!

00:16:57.230 --> 00:17:03.970
When I'm directly attacked, I can halve your 
monster's attack points until the End Phase.

00:17:03.970 --> 00:17:06.070
I also draw one card!

00:17:11.540 --> 00:17:14.170
What?  You survived?

00:17:14.170 --> 00:17:16.150
But it's still my turn!

00:17:16.150 --> 00:17:18.780
I activate Speed Spell - Speed Demon!

00:17:18.780 --> 00:17:23.250
When I have 3 Speed Counters, 
you take 1000 points of damage!

00:17:25.640 --> 00:17:28.740
She survived, but she only 
has 300 life points left.

00:17:28.740 --> 00:17:30.120
This is bad.

00:17:30.120 --> 00:17:33.050
I set one card and end my turn!

00:17:33.600 --> 00:17:35.600
My turn.  I draw!

00:17:38.230 --> 00:17:40.470
I summon Witch of the Black Rose!

00:17:42.790 --> 00:17:47.560
When I successfully summon this 
card, I draw one card from my deck.

00:17:47.560 --> 00:17:51.870
If that card isn't a monster, 
this card is destroyed.

00:17:51.870 --> 00:17:52.850
I draw!

00:17:53.240 --> 00:17:55.710
I drew Dark Verger!

00:17:56.070 --> 00:17:57.590
I activate my trap!

00:17:57.590 --> 00:17:59.320
Climactic Barricade!

00:17:59.880 --> 00:18:02.410
I can activate it when you summon a monster.

00:18:02.410 --> 00:18:06.190
Level 4-or-below monsters 
can't attack this turn!

00:18:06.190 --> 00:18:09.900
Izayoi, I sealed your 
Witch of the Black Rose!

00:18:09.900 --> 00:18:13.850
At the End Phase, Climactic Barricade 
deals 500 points of damage

00:18:13.850 --> 00:18:17.400
for every one of your 
Level 4-or-below monsters!

00:18:17.400 --> 00:18:20.450
If you don't defeat me this 
turn, you're finished!

00:18:21.350 --> 00:18:23.600
I have 4 Speed Counters.

00:18:24.650 --> 00:18:28.450
I activate Speed Spell - 
Summon Speeder from my hand!

00:18:28.450 --> 00:18:32.660
I Special Summon a Level 
4-or-below monster from my hand.

00:18:33.430 --> 00:18:36.660
Aki mastered Speed Spells.

00:18:36.660 --> 00:18:41.400
Level 4 Witch of the Black Rose 
tunes Level 2 Dark Verger!

00:18:41.400 --> 00:18:45.090
The beautiful thorn hunter lives 
deep in the sacred forest.

00:18:45.090 --> 00:18:48.650
Show yourself wielding 
the whip of punishment!

00:18:48.650 --> 00:18:50.210
Synchro Summon!

00:18:50.210 --> 00:18:52.840
Appear, Splendid Rose!

00:18:53.170 --> 00:18:55.510
Splendid Rose's effect!

00:18:55.510 --> 00:18:58.340
By removing a Plant-Type monster 
in my graveyard from play...

00:18:58.340 --> 00:19:02.970
...one monster's attack points are 
halved until this turn's End Phase!

00:19:02.970 --> 00:19:07.600
Your Stygian Sergeants's 
attack points are halved!

00:19:09.130 --> 00:19:10.190
Battle!

00:19:10.190 --> 00:19:13.460
Splendid Rose attacks Stygian Sergeants!

00:19:18.030 --> 00:19:20.040
How dare you!

00:19:20.040 --> 00:19:20.820
I'm not done!

00:19:20.820 --> 00:19:22.550
I still have to pay you back!

00:19:22.550 --> 00:19:23.270
What?

00:19:23.980 --> 00:19:25.820
I flip over my trap card!

00:19:25.820 --> 00:19:27.390
Blossom Bombardment!

00:19:27.390 --> 00:19:30.480
When a Plant-Type monster 
destroys your monster...

00:19:30.480 --> 00:19:33.630
...you take damage equal 
to half its attack points!

00:19:34.460 --> 00:19:36.450
Nicely done.

00:19:37.260 --> 00:19:39.760
The instructor is losing!

00:19:39.760 --> 00:19:41.430
That girl...

00:19:41.430 --> 00:19:43.540
It's time to finish her!

00:19:50.900 --> 00:19:51.870
Aki!

00:19:52.400 --> 00:19:53.860
Sucker!

00:19:56.710 --> 00:19:58.110
Is she in trouble?

00:19:58.300 --> 00:20:01.980
If she falls, the test is over!

00:20:03.820 --> 00:20:09.920
The speed and wind inform me about 
the rumblings in Yusei's heart.

00:20:09.920 --> 00:20:11.920
And my heart too.

00:20:12.610 --> 00:20:17.030
That's something only Riding 
Duelists can understand!

00:20:17.190 --> 00:20:19.420
I want to understand!

00:20:19.420 --> 00:20:22.350
That's why I can't stop here!

00:20:28.910 --> 00:20:30.690
Incredible!

00:20:30.690 --> 00:20:31.880
It came in use!

00:20:34.540 --> 00:20:37.080
She avoided those obstacles.

00:20:37.080 --> 00:20:39.850
I'll also become the wind!

00:20:41.020 --> 00:20:43.250
Splendid Rose's effect!

00:20:43.250 --> 00:20:44.990
If it attacked during the Battle Phase,

00:20:45.170 --> 00:20:48.000
I can remove a Plant-Type monster 
in my graveyard from play.

00:20:48.000 --> 00:20:52.370
By halving its attack points, 
it can attack again!

00:20:53.230 --> 00:20:56.690
Splendid Rose attacks you directly!

00:21:07.280 --> 00:21:08.980
Well done!

00:21:09.950 --> 00:21:11.290
You pass.

00:21:11.950 --> 00:21:13.950
She did it!

00:21:13.950 --> 00:21:14.560
Aki.

00:21:14.560 --> 00:21:15.920
She did it!

00:21:20.970 --> 00:21:22.860
We'll get you next time...

00:21:25.690 --> 00:21:28.540
All the players are falling into place.

00:21:35.770 --> 00:21:39.400
Aki, welcome to the world of Riding Duels!

00:22:08.920 --> 00:22:13.600
The small cliff floats on the Milky Way

00:22:13.600 --> 00:22:18.610
The sights I see are different 
than what I imagined

00:22:18.900 --> 00:22:23.510
Were you able to move on from the past?

00:22:23.510 --> 00:22:28.520
The answer isn't no, but 
there's something missing

00:22:28.720 --> 00:22:33.390
The cruel god tests us

00:22:33.690 --> 00:22:40.330
Let's fill the emptiness 
and head to the next stage

00:22:40.330 --> 00:22:44.200
If you ask me "What's our relationship?"

00:22:44.200 --> 00:22:50.070
We're more than friends... 
but that's not quite right

00:22:50.240 --> 00:22:54.000
Bond is the proper word

00:22:54.000 --> 00:22:59.970
As we fight, we understand each other

00:22:59.970 --> 00:23:02.940
"Where are you right now?"  "On Earth"

00:23:02.940 --> 00:23:05.170
Because I'm not an astronaut

00:23:05.170 --> 00:23:09.850
I have no problems when 
I'm below the ozone layer

00:23:10.140 --> 00:23:12.710
"I know, I'm coming right away."

00:23:12.710 --> 00:23:16.180
You want to party until the morning

00:23:16.180 --> 00:23:19.420
At our special place
